      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im like 3 weeks out from having the flu and i thought i was better but lately im just feeling super wiped out. like even walking up my stairs makes me feel really winded and out of breath. plus my chest feels heavy sometimes and my heart feels like it's fluttering? is this just like long term fatigue or something? im kinda worried but maybe im just overthinking it",
