      "content": "idk i just feel like im being dramatic lol. i have no insurance so going to a doctor is gonna be crazy expensive and honestly i feel way too tired to even drive anywhere right now. do u think it could just be that my body is still fighting the virus? like maybe i just need more electrolytes or some vitamins or something to get my energy back up?",
