      "content": "i mean i guess so, but i really dont want to deal with a hospital bill if i dont have to. i used to take some high dose vitamin b complex and magnesium to help with fatigue when i was in college and it worked pretty well. do u think taking a really high dose of magnesium and some extra electrolytes might help stabilize things so i dont feel so dizzy and shaky? i just want to try fixing it at home first if possible.",
